INTRO TO INTEGRATION
\int_a^b x^2 dx = \frac{1}{3}b^3 \quad [a=0]
[Riemann Sum]
(b/n)(b/n)^2 + b/n(2b/n)^2 + \dots + (b/n)(nb/n)^2 = \sum_{i=1}^n \frac{b}{n} \left(\frac{ib}{n}\right)^2 = \frac{b^3}{n^3} \sum_{i=1}^n i^2
= \frac{b^3}{n^3} \sum_{i=1}^n i^2 \approx \frac{b^3}{n^3} \int_0^n x^2 dx = \frac{b^3}{n^3} \cdot \frac{1}{3}n^3 = \frac{1}{3}b^3
= \lim_{n \to \infty} \frac{1}{3}b^3
